+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+This project requires TLS certificate verification to be enabled in all builds, including development builds. The previous exemption that disabled certificate verification in development builds as a workaround has been removed, and there is no longer a supported way to build with certificate verification turned off, ensuring a consistent security posture and eliminating a potential man-in-the-middle exposure across all development and production environments.
